                "text": "Thrilled to have Andrea Packard, a dental assistant serving patients in the North Country and a student at @NHTI, as my guest for tonight's Joint Session of Congress. \n\n\ud83d\udcfa A message before tonight's address: https://t.co/MNcQfFxxe6",
