                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We have a sacred obligation to our servicemembers and our military families \u2013 that includes ensuring they have the same access to health care coverage as every other American.\n\nI\u2019m proud to introduce the Health Care Fairness for Military Families Act. This commonsense bill will save hundreds of thousands of American military families thousands of dollars every year.",
