                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Healthcare costs are already sky-high, and the GOP\u2019s Big, Brutal Budget is jacking up costs across the board. \n\nImportant conversation in Concord this afternoon with patients and non-profit healthcare providers about what\u2019s at stake. I am fighting with absolutely everything I got to lower your costs and protect your healthcare.",
